People will dance.
人们会跳舞。

01:05:32.820 --> 01:05:34.219
Oh, people will dance.
噢，人们会跳舞。

01:05:35.219 --> 01:05:37.659
I am guilty.
我有罪。

01:05:37.659 --> 01:05:39.539
Please equip me.
请宽恕我吧。

01:05:39.539 --> 01:05:44.059
All sins are forgiven in New York City.
